{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sunset Drive</i> is a narrative road trip game about two people, one car, and the time you share before the day fades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a gentle, intimate journey shaped by conversation, small choices, and quiet detours. You\u2019ll sit with silence, speak when it matters, and maybe uncover things that were left unsaid for too long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a story about slowing down and noticing the little things. Glances, memories, missed turns that stay with us more than we realize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the trip ends, you can look back on where you\u2019ve been or take the drive again, and see where a different path might lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports English and Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Talk. Stop. Discover. The road is yours.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hit the road!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/11278cc9c3afe5278d4a6622d966d16940a42e47.jpg"},{"name":"Dawn, it's beautiful!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/b979e2a878b847783645d0cd8a6b175de7aacb43.jpg"},{"name":"Hello, sunshine!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/f57aca33ebe412781237f62fbfec38ea1312f780.jpg"},{"name":"Solemn luxury","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/3612078876bd990662ac4ae956efb250fd93e5d4.jpg"},{"name":"Sorry, I'm latte!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/da0f139f2013598a57e2d699cad651e56e1e0bd4.jpg"},{"name":"Man of the woods","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/84817860b4792d00f9a021ac2e9496c8b53d6e52.jpg"},{"name"